# ============================================================
# Jarvis Lite — direct dependencies only.
#
# This file lists WHAT the project needs (top-level packages).
# requirements.txt is the pinned lockfile — install from that.
#
# To regenerate requirements.txt after changing this file:
#   pip install pip-tools
#   pip-compile requirements.in --output-file requirements.txt
# ============================================================

